    "### How many diffusers do I need for a one-bedroom?",
    "Usually two — one near the entry and one in the living area, the two zones that set the impression of the whole place. For an open-plan studio, a single larger-capacity unit like the Reservoir 4L covers the shared air better than several small ones.",
    "### Is it safe to run a diffuser all day in a small space?",
