    "## How to Choose: What Actually Matters",
    "**Coverage / square footage.** This is the first question. A single room is a standalone job; a multi-room property wants HVAC integration. Coverage depends on the air volume of the space, not just the floor area — high ceilings need more. When in doubt, send us the square footage and we will confirm the fit.",
    "**Scheduling control.** A business does not want full scent at 3 a.m. Smart units let you set run times and intensity from an app, so you get full scent during open hours and dial it back or off overnight — which also keeps oil cost predictable.",
    "**Contract terms.** This is where most scent-marketing companies trap you. Look for equipment you own outright and month-to-month oil plans, not a multi-month lock-in before you can cancel.",
    "**Support and multi-unit pricing.** If you are scenting more than one room or location, you want real volume pricing and a person who answers email — not a \"contact sales\" wall.",
    "## The Autivara Commercial Lineup at a Glance",
    "| Model | Delivery | Best for | Starts at |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Plug smart wall | Plug-in | Small rooms, restrooms | $79 |\n| Atmos Wi-Fi | Standalone cold-air | Reception, salon, boutique | $149 |\n| Atmos Pro | HVAC-integrated | Lobbies, gyms, multi-room | $349 |",
    "### The easy pick for a single space",
    "Scenting one room — a reception area, studio, or boutique? Start with the [Atmos Wi-Fi standalone unit](/product/autivora-atmos-wifi-diffuser). You get cold-air diffusion and app scheduling without touching your HVAC.",
